# Remote node: the device restarts with the node out of reach. Its contacts
# and the node's name show anyway (kept on this device); a message can't be
# sent until the link is back.
# remote-only
node Bob 7.5 echo
as Bob advert
wait 3000
expect contacts 1
# (saved to flash 10 s after the last change)
wait 15000
ble off
reboot
wait 3000
expect linked 0
expect contacts 1
shot offline-home
key right
key enter
key enter
type hello
key enter
shot offline-send
expect window 0
ble on
wait 6000
expect linked 1
expect contacts 1
